      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The whole cycle · how the tools hang together. A map, not a step tool: one container per section of the cycle map sheet, read it and glance at the e.g. lines.\nMade by Claude (AI) from Anna (@annaothercrow)'s toolkit. The order inside each phase and the loops are Claude's reading.",
